      "filename": "Willow poles ready for planting (8465730747).jpg",
      "title": "File:Willow poles ready for planting (8465730747).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/Willow_poles_ready_for_planting_%288465730747%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
